  <main id="main">

    <!-- 1. One idea: what we do, said plainly. A real photo carries it. -->
    <section class="hp-hero">
      <div class="hp-wrap hp-hero__grid">
        <div class="hp-hero__text">
          <p class="hp-kicker">AI for small businesses · South Africa</p>
          <h1>Your team types all day. <em>(Let AI do the typing)</em></h1>
          <p class="hp-lead">Customer emails, invoices, quotes, the same questions over and over. AI drafts it, a person checks it, and you get the hours back. If it isn&rsquo;t worth it for your business, we&rsquo;ll tell you.</p>
          <div class="hp-actions">
            <a class="hp-btn" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-hero-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
            <a class="hp-link" href="live-demo?sample=email" data-track="cta-hero-watch">Watch it work an inbox &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="hp-device" data-photo="1">
          <!-- Swap for a real photo later: assets/photos/hero.jpg -->
          <img src="assets/shots/phone-email.jpg" alt="The inbox example on a phone: a customer asks for a price to service three aircons, and the reply is drafted with the price, a gap for the day, and the sign-off." width="875" height="1073" />
          <figcaption>A real reply from the inbox example: the price filled in, the day left for a person to choose.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- The plan, as in the Let's Build videos: four steps -->
    <section class="hp-flow">
      <div class="hp-wrap">
        <p class="hp-num">01</p>
        <h2>The plan</h2>
        <p class="hp-flow__lead">A simple flow: incoming email &rarr; classification &rarr; routing &rarr; response.</p>
        <ol class="hp-steps">
          <li><span class="hp-step__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><rect x="6" y="11" width="36" height="26" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="m7 13 17 13 17-13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><b>Incoming email</b><span>New message received</span></li>
          <li><span class="hp-step__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M24 9c-4-4-12-2-12 5-5 1-6 8-2 11-3 5 1 11 7 10 1 4 5 5 7 3V9Zm0 0c4-4 12-2 12 5 5 1 6 8 2 11 3 5-1 11-7 10-1 4-5 5-7 3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M24 16h-5M24 24h-7M24 31h-4M24 20h6M24 28h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><b>Classification</b><span>AI reads what it&rsquo;s about and what they want</span></li>
          <li><span class="hp-step__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="13" cy="12" r="4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M17 12h14a7 7 0 0 1 0 14H17a7 7 0 0 0 0 14h18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="m31 35 5 5-5 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><b>Routing</b><span>Sends it to the right person or folder</span></li>
          <li><span class="hp-step__ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><rect x="6" y="11" width="36" height="26" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="m7 13 17 13 17-13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><b>Response</b><span>A reply drafted, or a person told to follow up</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. Show the real thing, not icons. -->
    <section class="hp-show">
      <div class="hp-wrap">
        <div class="hp-show__head">
          <div><p class="hp-num hp-num--light">02</p><h2>This is what it does with a normal morning.</h2></div>
          <p>Ten emails in. Replies drafted, invoices forwarded, the long thread summarised, the angry customer flagged for a person. You can run it yourself: it takes a minute.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="hp-shot" href="live-demo?sample=email" aria-label="Run the inbox example" data-track="home-shot-email">
          <img src="assets/shots/email.jpg" alt="The inbox example after running: ten emails, each drafted, forwarded, filed or flagged, with 37 minutes saved." width="1240" height="560" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="hp-shot__go">Run it yourself &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <ul class="hp-more" aria-label="More examples">
          <li><a href="live-demo?sample=calls">Phone calls answered at 11pm</a></li>
          <li><a href="live-demo?sample=invoices">Invoices captured without retyping</a></li>
          <li><a href="live-demo?sample=followups">Quotes followed up before they go cold</a></li>
          <li><a href="live-demo?sample=meetings">Meeting notes and to-dos</a></li>
          <li><a href="ai-demos">All ten examples</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- The result: before and after, as in the videos -->
    <section class="hp-ba">
      <div class="hp-wrap">
        <p class="hp-num">03</p>
        <h2>The result</h2>
        <div class="hp-ba__grid">
          <div class="hp-ba__before"><h3>Before</h3><ul><li>Sorting every email by hand</li><li>Enquiries missed or answered late</li><li>The same reply typed again</li><li>Admin eating the day</li></ul></div>
          <span class="hp-ba__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          <div class="hp-ba__after"><h3>After</h3><ul><li>Every email sorted on arrival</li><li>Sent to the right person</li><li>Replies drafted in seconds</li><li>Time back for the real work</li></ul></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. A voice nobody else would use. -->
    <section class="hp-honest">
      <div class="hp-wrap hp-honest__grid">
        <h2>Most of the AI we&rsquo;re asked to build shouldn&rsquo;t be built.</h2>
        <div>
          <p>So the first thing we do is time the work. How long does a reply take today? How many come in? Who checks it? If the answer is &ldquo;ten minutes, twice a week&rdquo;, we say so and you keep your money.</p>
          <p>When it is worth it, you see the number before you pay for anything big: timed before, and timed the same way after.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. The way in: one offer, plainly priced. -->
    <section class="hp-offer">
      <div class="hp-wrap hp-offer__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="hp-kicker">The easiest place to start</p>
          <h2>The Inbox Assistant</h2>
          <p>Every routine customer email, drafted in seconds from your own prices and policies. Your team checks it and presses send. Nothing goes out on its own.</p>
          <a class="hp-btn hp-btn--light" href="inbox-assistant" data-track="cta-home-inbox">How it works</a>
        </div>
        <dl class="hp-terms">
          <div><dt>Ready</dt><dd>within 3 business days</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Trial</dt><dd>two weeks, on your real emails</dd></div>
          <div><dt>You pay</dt><dd>only if it saves your team 5 hours a week</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Then</dt><dd>R9,500 setup, R2,950 a month</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. The person, without the name. -->
    <section class="hp-who">
      <div class="hp-wrap hp-who__grid">
        <figure class="hp-map" data-photo="2">
          <!-- Swap for a real photo later: assets/photos/at-work.jpg -->
          <img src="assets/art/process-map.svg" alt="A hand-drawn process map of one quote email: six steps at about 6 minutes, four of them done by AI, so it takes about 1 minute." width="520" height="650" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <div>
          <h2>One developer. No account managers.</h2>
          <p>The person who sits with you and maps how the work flows is the person who builds it, and the one who answers when something needs fixing. Everything can be done online, so we work with businesses anywhere in South Africa.</p>
          <ol class="hp-promises">
            <li>We&rsquo;ll say if AI isn&rsquo;t worth it, even if it costs us the job.</li>
            <li>You&rsquo;ll see the time saved, measured before and after.</li>
            <li>You own everything: the system, the accounts, the data.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 6. Prices in one line each, no cards. -->
    <section class="hp-prices">
      <div class="hp-wrap">
        <h2>What things cost</h2>
        <table class="hp-table">
          <tr><th>Inbox Assistant</th><td>R9,500 setup + R2,950 a month, paid only if it works</td></tr>
          <tr><th>An AI system for one process</th><td>from R25,000 to build</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Automations and dashboards</th><td>from R15,000</td></tr>
          <tr><th>Websites</th><td>from R12,500</td></tr>
        </table>
        <p class="hp-small">Starting prices. You get a fixed quote, with every monthly cost, before any work starts. <a href="pricing">All prices</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 7. One last ask. -->
    <section class="hp-end">
      <div class="hp-wrap hp-end__grid">
        <figure class="hp-device hp-device--small" data-photo="3">
          <!-- Swap for a real photo later: assets/photos/detail.jpg -->
          <img src="assets/shots/phone-chat.jpg" alt="The enquiries example on a phone: a WhatsApp message asking for Saturday gel nails, answered with two open times and the price." width="875" height="1073" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
        <div>
          <h2>Tell us what takes too long.</h2>
          <p>Thirty minutes, on a video call. You tell us about the work; we tell you honestly whether AI is worth it, and roughly what it would cost. No slides.</p>
          <div class="hp-actions">
            <a class="hp-btn" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-home-book-end">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
            <a class="hp-link" href="https://wa.me/27722375833" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-home-wa">Or WhatsApp 072 237 5833 &rarr;</a>
          </div>
          <p class="hp-small" style="margin-top:1.2rem">Prefer to write? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-review-open>Tell us in a few lines</button></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
